[
  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186166867,
      "id": "53a1649d-4279-5b7c-839c-728f333b2c3f",
      "title": "Calculating the Slope of the Tangent to a Parabola"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "664a01c7-7461-513a-a64a-4d134802032d",
      ":question/problem": "![](/tmp/course-academy-g2-readonly-tly0pcma/17592186166867/caller-moderate/generated/4ca3e7afbbe7672cc0aa38353b5babfac8f6a132d6435936487f9bb8d6190b87.png)\n\nFind $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for the right-opening parabola shown above. Express the answer in terms of the variable $y.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "b7d4a7b7-66e8-548f-aa10-1fddd981b1e1",
          ":answer-field/key": "field-1",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/blank",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "03226fed-d11b-56dd-b779-0eded8f0f602",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\frac{18}{7y}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "03226fed-d11b-56dd-b779-0eded8f0f602"
          ]
        }
      ],
      ":question/worked-solution": "The diagram shows that the parabola has its vertex at $O,$ and passes through the point $(7,6).$\n\nThe standard equation of a left- or right-opening parabola whose vertex is at $(0,0)$ is given by\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=4px.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=7$ and $y=6$ into the equation above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(6)^{2} & =4p(7) \\\\ 36 & =28p \\\\ p & =\\frac{9}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation of our parabola is \n\n$$\n{y}^{2}=\\frac{36}{7}x.\n$$\n\nFinally, to calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x},$ we use implicit differentiation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({y}^{2}) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{36}{7}x) \\\\ 2y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{36}{7} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{18}{7y}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate"
    },
